data: {"id": "eaad4a1fd1134d45-thinking-parallel_evidence-703", "run_id": "eaad4a1fd1134d45", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将执行证据计划中的 Kubernetes 工具，以补充 Prometheus、Logging、Tracing 的首轮结果。Prometheus 已确认 Pod 处于 Pending 阶段且容器等待原因为 ContainerCreating。\n\n### 执行计划\n1. **kubectl_describe**: 获取 Pod 详细状态和 Events。\n2. **kubectl_get_yaml**: 获取 Pod Spec 中的 volumes 定义。\n3. **kubectl_events**: 获取异常事件。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789045268315, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

